{"seq":7,"slug":"text-direction","title":"文本方向与双向文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-direction","wordCount":712,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本方向与双向文本\">文本方向与双向文本</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本方向（Text Direction）是 Web 国际化中的关键技术问题。Unicode 双向算法（Bidi Algorithm）定义了混合方向文本的排列规则——当 RTL 文本（如阿拉伯语）中嵌入 LTR 文本（如英文、数字）时，浏览器需要自动确定每个字符的显示方向。理解双向文本的工作原理是构建真正全球化 Web 应用的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[文本方向] --&gt; B[基础方向 Base Direction]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Bidi 算法]&#10;    A --&gt; D[方向控制字符]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[LTR 从左到右]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[RTL 从右到左]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[隐式方向解析]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[显式方向覆盖]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[LRM/RLM 标记]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[LRE/RLE 嵌入]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[LRI/RLI 隔离]\">graph TB\n    A[文本方向] --&gt; B[基础方向 Base Direction]\n    A --&gt; C[Bidi 算法]\n    A --&gt; D[方向控制字符]\n    B --&gt; B1[LTR 从左到右]\n    B --&gt; B2[RTL 从右到左]\n    C --&gt; C1[隐式方向解析]\n    C --&gt; C2[显式方向覆盖]\n    D --&gt; D1[LRM/RLM 标记]\n    D --&gt; D2[LRE/RLE 嵌入]\n    D --&gt; D3[LRI/RLI 隔离]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>HTML 实现</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础方向</td>\n<td>段落的主方向</td>\n<td>dir=&quot;ltr/rtl/auto&quot;</td>\n<td>确定文本流起始边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强方向字符</td>\n<td>有固有方向的字符</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>字母、阿拉伯字母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱方向字符</td>\n<td>方向取决于上下文</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>数字、标点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性字符</td>\n<td>无方向性</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>空格、换行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向隔离</td>\n<td>防止方向溢出</td>\n<td><code>&lt;bdi&gt;</code></td>\n<td>用户生成内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向覆盖</td>\n<td>强制指定方向</td>\n<td><code>&lt;bdo&gt;</code></td>\n<td>特殊排版需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"unicode-双向算法\">Unicode 双向算法</h2><p>Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm（UBA）是浏览器处理混合方向文本的标准。算法分为隐式和显式两种解析模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const bidiCharacterTypes: Record&lt;string, string[]&gt; = {&#10;  strongLTR: [&#39;A-Z&#39;, &#39;a-z&#39;, &#39;Latin&#39;, &#39;Greek&#39;, &#39;Cyrillic&#39;],&#10;  strongRTL: [&#39;Arabic&#39;, &#39;Hebrew&#39;, &#39;Thaana&#39;, &#39;Syriac&#39;],&#10;  weak: [&#39;0-9&#39;, &#39;European number separators&#39;, &#39;Currency symbols&#39;],&#10;  neutral: [&#39;Whitespace&#39;, &#39;Most punctuation&#39;, &#39;Paragraph separators&#39;],&#10;};&#10;&#10;const demonstrateBidiIssue = (): void =&gt; {&#10;  const fileName = &#39;report_2024.pdf&#39;;&#10;  const arabicText = &#39;الملف&#39;;&#10;&#10;  const withoutIsolation = `${arabicText}: ${fileName}`;&#10;  const withIsolation = `\\u2067${arabicText}\\u2069: ${fileName}`;&#10;&#10;  console.log(&#39;无隔离:&#39;, withoutIsolation);&#10;  console.log(&#39;有隔离:&#39;, withIsolation);&#10;};&#10;&#10;const unicodeDirectionMarkers = {&#10;  LRM: &#39;\\u200E&#39;,&#10;  RLM: &#39;\\u200F&#39;,&#10;  LRE: &#39;\\u202A&#39;,&#10;  RLE: &#39;\\u202B&#39;,&#10;  PDF: &#39;\\u202C&#39;,&#10;  LRO: &#39;\\u202D&#39;,&#10;  RLO: &#39;\\u202E&#39;,&#10;  LRI: &#39;\\u2066&#39;,&#10;  RLI: &#39;\\u2067&#39;,&#10;  FSI: &#39;\\u2068&#39;,&#10;  PDI: &#39;\\u2069&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bidiCharacterTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  strongLTR: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A-Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'a-z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Latin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Greek'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Cyrillic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  strongRTL: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Arabic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hebrew'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Thaana'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Syriac'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  weak: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0-9'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'European number separators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Currency symbols'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  neutral: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Whitespace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Most punctuation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Paragraph separators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrateBidiIssue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fileName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'report_2024.pdf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> arabicText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'الملف'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withoutIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arabicText</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fileName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withIsolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2067</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arabicText</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2069</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fileName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无隔离:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, withoutIsolation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'有隔离:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, withIsolation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unicodeDirectionMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  LRM: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u200E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RLM: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u200F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  LRE: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u202A</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RLE: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u202B</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PDF: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u202C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  LRO: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u202D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RLO: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u202E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  LRI: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2066</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RLI: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2067</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  FSI: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2068</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PDI: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2069</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向标记</th>\n<th>Unicode</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>推荐使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LRM</td>\n<td>U+200E</td>\n<td>左到右标记</td>\n<td>数字方向修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RLM</td>\n<td>U+200F</td>\n<td>右到左标记</td>\n<td>嵌入 RTL 片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LRI</td>\n<td>U+2066</td>\n<td>左到右隔离</td>\n<td>隔离 LTR 文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RLI</td>\n<td>U+2067</td>\n<td>右到左隔离</td>\n<td>隔离 RTL 文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FSI</td>\n<td>U+2068</td>\n<td>首强字符隔离</td>\n<td>自动检测方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDI</td>\n<td>U+2069</td>\n<td>结束隔离</td>\n<td>结束上述隔离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"html-方向控制\">HTML 方向控制</h2><p>HTML 提供了 <code>dir</code> 属性、<code>&lt;bdi&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;bdo&gt;</code> 元素来控制文本方向。<code>dir=&quot;auto&quot;</code> 让浏览器根据首个强方向字符自动判断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- dir=&quot;auto&quot; 自动检测内容方向 --&gt;&#10;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hello, this is English text.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;مرحبا، هذا نص عربي.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- bdi 隔离未知方向内容 --&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;  &lt;li&gt;用户 &lt;bdi&gt;إيان&lt;/bdi&gt;: 15 条评论&lt;/li&gt;&#10;  &lt;li&gt;用户 &lt;bdi&gt;john_doe&lt;/bdi&gt;: 23 条评论&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- bdo 强制方向覆盖 --&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文: Hello&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;反向: &lt;bdo dir=&quot;rtl&quot;&gt;Hello&lt;/bdo&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- dir=\"auto\" 自动检测内容方向 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><sp